  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  We prove that no packing of unit balls in R^5 whose centres form two
  translates of a lattice is denser than the D5 lattice packing. Up to
  congruence exactly three such packings attain this density: √2 D5, a
  layered packing of Leech, and the packing with Szöllősi's kissing
  configuration.
